  "notes": "{広|ひろ}まる describes information, customs, or influence spreading among people or across an area.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive)\n- Pair: {広|ひろ}める (transitive, to spread something)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{広|ひろ}まっている indicates something has spread and is now widespread.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {噂|うわさ}が{広|ひろ}まる: a rumor spreads\n- {習慣|しゅうかん}が{広|ひろ}まる: a custom spreads\n- {世界中|せかいじゅう}に{広|ひろ}まる: to spread throughout the world\n- {急速|きゅうそく}に{広|ひろ}まる: to spread rapidly\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {広|ひろ}がる: to spread physically (in space); {広|ひろ}まる focuses on spread among people or as knowledge",
